# Environment files for this repository (never commit a real .env):
#   apps/api/.env        API settings. Copy apps/api/.env.example and fill in the values you need.
#   apps/web/.env.local  Website settings (optional). Copy apps/web/.env.example.
# For a first run no file is needed: `npm run dev:mock` uses a mock model and an in-memory store.
# See docs/guides/local-setup.md for the full list of variables.
